## Documentation Scope

Only the **Executive Summary** is made publicly available in this repository.

The complete project documentation contains substantially more detailed technical work, analyses, calculations and design data and is therefore **not distributed publicly**.

The material provided here is intended to present the project's overall scope, architecture and main engineering outcomes while preserving the detailed technical work developed during the project.

---

## Notes

KIRA was developed as an academic group project within the MSc in Aeronautical Engineering at **Politecnico di Milano**.

The Executive Summary reflects multidisciplinary team work. My contribution and responsibility were primarily in **team leadership, aircraft-level integration, mission and system architecture, preliminary sizing, multidisciplinary coordination and design decision-making**.
